# Session state — never committed (AGENTS.md).
STATE.md

# Local tooling, if any (protoc et al. never enter this repo).
.tools/

# Harness gate config — machine-local paths (allowPaths), not repo content.
gates.json

# Audit-effort scratch (issue bodies, tmux state) and parallel worktrees.
.audit-work/
.worktrees/

# e2e smoke build artifact and its log (scripts/e2e-orchestrator.sh cleans up,
# but a failed run must not dirty the tree).
.e2e-*
